   - For each stop `i`, calculate the new number of passengers in the tram after the stop:
     \[
     \text{new\_capacity} = \text{current\_capacity} - \text{ai} + \text{bi}
     \]
   - Update `current_capacity` to the new capacity.

4. **Track Maximum Capacity**: Keep track of the maximum capacity encountered during the iteration.

